WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:01.870
Hi, I'm Chris.

00:00:01.870 --> 00:00:03.680
After 10 years working
in corporate finance,

00:00:03.680 --> 00:00:05.950
I quit my job, sold everything
I owned, and moved here

00:00:05.950 --> 00:00:08.260
to live in the wilderness
of Alberta, Canada

00:00:09.809 --> 00:00:11.065
♪ I wanna get away from it all ♪

00:00:11.065 --> 00:00:12.273
♪ Move out of the 'burbs ♪

00:00:12.273 --> 00:00:13.364
♪ Wake up in the morning ♪

00:00:13.364 --> 00:00:14.552
♪ To the bugs and the birds ♪

00:00:14.552 --> 00:00:15.709
♪ Collect wood for a fire ♪

00:00:15.709 --> 00:00:16.542
♪ And bathe in a stream ♪

00:00:16.542 --> 00:00:18.192
♪ I be getting back to nature ♪

00:00:18.192 --> 00:00:19.555
♪ I be living the dream ♪

00:00:19.555 --> 00:00:20.643
♪ I can forage for nuts ♪

00:00:20.643 --> 00:00:21.928
♪ I can live off the land ♪

00:00:21.928 --> 00:00:23.149
♪ I meet a tiny squirrel ♪

00:00:23.149 --> 00:00:24.476
♪ Let him eat from my hand ♪

00:00:24.476 --> 00:00:25.652
♪ Learn the names of the plants ♪

00:00:25.652 --> 00:00:27.022
♪ Learn the names of the trees ♪

00:00:27.022 --> 00:00:28.186
♪ This one's Ian ♪

00:00:28.186 --> 00:00:29.501
♪ And this one's Keith ♪

00:00:29.501 --> 00:00:30.709
♪ Get away from it all ♪

00:00:30.709 --> 00:00:31.730
♪ Live while I'm young ♪

00:00:31.730 --> 00:00:33.107
♪ Ignore calls from my wife ♪

00:00:33.107 --> 00:00:34.224
♪ And my infant son ♪

00:00:34.224 --> 00:00:35.452
♪ I got a new life now ♪

00:00:35.452 --> 00:00:36.689
♪ It's one I prefer ♪

00:00:36.689 --> 00:00:37.882
♪ Living free in the wild ♪

00:00:37.882 --> 00:00:39.304
♪ Just me and my squirrel ♪

00:00:39.304 --> 00:00:40.295
♪ I struggle getting food ♪

00:00:40.295 --> 00:00:41.697
♪ Finding berries and nuts ♪

00:00:41.697 --> 00:00:42.875
♪ Feeling hungry got a rumble ♪

00:00:42.875 --> 00:00:44.262
♪ In the middle of my gut ♪

00:00:44.262 --> 00:00:45.260
♪ Call the squirrel over ♪

00:00:45.260 --> 00:00:46.470
♪ Betray his trust ♪

00:00:46.470 --> 00:00:47.798
♪ Kill him, cook him, eat him ♪

00:00:47.798 --> 00:00:49.075
♪ And cry in disgust ♪

00:00:49.075 --> 00:00:51.634
♪ I be living my life in the wilderness ♪

00:00:51.634 --> 00:00:54.051
♪ Going off grid no need for stress ♪

00:00:54.051 --> 00:00:56.453
♪ I know a lotta y'all
would kill for this ♪

00:00:56.453 --> 00:00:58.948
♪ Forget about the past,
start life afresh ♪

00:00:58.948 --> 00:01:01.271
♪ Quit the rat race, leave it all behind ♪

00:01:01.271 --> 00:01:03.705
♪ Break free of your
chains, don't be confined ♪

00:01:03.705 --> 00:01:06.337
♪ Be wild, the way that man's designed ♪

00:01:06.337 --> 00:01:08.384
♪ And live in a wilderness state of mind ♪

00:01:08.384 --> 00:01:09.749
♪ I wanna get away from it all ♪

00:01:09.749 --> 00:01:10.986
♪ Like a lumberjack ♪

00:01:10.986 --> 00:01:13.516
♪ Just me and my Hemingway paperback ♪

00:01:13.516 --> 00:01:14.709
♪ Collect my own water ♪

00:01:14.709 --> 00:01:15.542
♪ Shit in a hole ♪

00:01:15.542 --> 00:01:17.067
♪ And weep as I do it ♪

00:01:17.067 --> 00:01:18.524
♪ 'Cause I feel so alone ♪

00:01:18.524 --> 00:01:19.607
♪ Be depressed ♪

00:01:19.607 --> 00:01:20.842
♪ Repress my feelings ♪

00:01:20.842 --> 00:01:21.962
♪ Then chop down Keith ♪

00:01:21.962 --> 00:01:23.361
♪ And chop down Ian ♪

00:01:23.361 --> 00:01:24.458
♪ Feel even more lonely ♪

00:01:24.458 --> 00:01:25.777
♪ 'Cause my friends are gone ♪

00:01:25.777 --> 00:01:26.897
♪ I miss them so I'm heading out ♪

00:01:26.897 --> 00:01:28.152
♪ To make a new one ♪

00:01:28.152 --> 00:01:29.376
♪ Get away from it all ♪

00:01:29.376 --> 00:01:30.644
♪ Roam round in the the forest ♪

00:01:30.644 --> 00:01:33.204
♪ In a few days come across
a wandering tourist ♪

00:01:33.204 --> 00:01:35.418
♪ Build a fire in the great outdoors ♪

00:01:35.418 --> 00:01:36.736
♪ Swap stories with the tourist ♪

00:01:36.736 --> 00:01:37.960
♪ Make delicious s'mores ♪

00:01:37.960 --> 00:01:39.093
♪ Make a new friend ♪

00:01:39.093 --> 00:01:40.499
♪ Feel happy again ♪

00:01:40.499 --> 00:01:42.977
♪ Barely even think about Noah and Jen ♪

00:01:42.977 --> 00:01:43.810
♪ My friend tries to leave ♪

00:01:43.810 --> 00:01:45.153
♪ In the following struggle ♪

00:01:45.153 --> 00:01:45.986
♪ I crush his skull with a rock ♪

00:01:45.986 --> 00:01:47.744
♪ So I pick up my shovel ♪

00:01:47.744 --> 00:01:50.356
♪ I be living my life in the wilderness ♪

00:01:50.356 --> 00:01:52.786
♪ Going off grid no need for stress ♪

00:01:52.786 --> 00:01:55.238
♪ I know a lotta y'all
would kill for this ♪

00:01:55.238 --> 00:01:57.717
♪ Forget about the past,
start life afresh ♪

00:01:57.717 --> 00:02:00.074
♪ Hiding in a cabin like Walter White ♪

00:02:00.074 --> 00:02:02.414
♪ Burn my fingerprints off with lye ♪

00:02:02.414 --> 00:02:04.771
♪ Wake up screaming five times a night ♪

00:02:04.771 --> 00:02:07.040
♪ Because I see my friend's
faces when I close my eyes ♪

00:02:07.040 --> 00:02:08.439
♪ I wanna get away from it all ♪

00:02:08.439 --> 00:02:09.743
♪ And jump in a lake ♪

00:02:09.743 --> 00:02:10.886
♪ So I gather up stones ♪

00:02:10.886 --> 00:02:13.243
♪ For additional weight ♪
♪ Write a note in blood ♪

00:02:13.243 --> 00:02:14.593
♪ On the back of a leaf ♪

00:02:14.593 --> 00:02:15.817
♪ Apologizing to my mates ♪

00:02:15.817 --> 00:02:17.027
♪ Break down with grief ♪

00:02:17.027 --> 00:02:18.262
♪ As I stand on the shore ♪

00:02:18.262 --> 00:02:19.095
♪ Thinking no one cares ♪

00:02:19.095 --> 00:02:20.640
♪ Out the corner of my eye ♪

00:02:20.640 --> 00:02:22.048
♪ A friendly bear ♪

00:02:22.048 --> 00:02:24.311
♪ Talk about the things in
common that we like to do ♪

00:02:24.311 --> 00:02:26.685
♪ Turns out she's killed
squirrels and tourists too ♪

00:02:26.685 --> 00:02:27.955
♪ Get away from it all ♪

00:02:27.955 --> 00:02:29.210
♪ With my grizzly friend ♪

00:02:29.210 --> 00:02:30.406
♪ Develop a bond ♪

00:02:30.406 --> 00:02:31.692
♪ But you know how it ends ♪

00:02:31.692 --> 00:02:34.081
(panting)

00:02:34.081 --> 00:02:35.323
♪ I had sex with the bear ♪

00:02:35.323 --> 00:02:36.156
♪ Then married the bear ♪

00:02:36.156 --> 00:02:37.847
♪ Had a cub with the bear ♪

00:02:37.847 --> 00:02:39.133
♪ Then I had an affair ♪

00:02:39.133 --> 00:02:40.186
♪ With a different bear ♪

00:02:40.186 --> 00:02:41.567
♪ So got divorced from the bear ♪

00:02:41.567 --> 00:02:42.620
♪ Wanted custody of kids ♪

00:02:42.620 --> 00:02:43.970
♪ So went to court with the bear ♪

00:02:43.970 --> 00:02:46.494
♪ Now I'm paying huge amounts
of child support to the bear ♪

00:02:46.494 --> 00:02:47.327
♪ Moral of the story is ♪

00:02:47.327 --> 00:02:48.493
♪ Don't have sex with bears ♪

00:02:49.960 --> 00:02:52.543
(wind blowing)

00:02:57.627 --> 00:02:59.835
(bear roars)

